{"seq":4,"slug":"gazebo-fundamentals","title":"Gazebo 仿真基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/robot-simulation/gazebo-fundamentals","wordCount":1149,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"gazebo-仿真基础\">Gazebo 仿真基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Gazebo 是 ROS 生态系统中最主流的机器人仿真器，提供物理引擎、传感器模拟和环境渲染能力。新一代 Gazebo（原 Ignition Gazebo）采用模块化架构，通过 ECS（Entity-Component-System）模式组织仿真世界中的所有实体。仿真是机器人开发的关键环节——在真实硬件部署之前验证算法、训练策略和测试安全边界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Gazebo 仿真] --&gt; B[物理引擎]&#10;    A --&gt; C[传感器插件]&#10;    A --&gt; D[环境渲染]&#10;    A --&gt; E[ROS 桥接]&#10;    B --&gt; F[DART / Bullet]&#10;    C --&gt; G[激光雷达]&#10;    C --&gt; H[相机/深度相机]&#10;    C --&gt; I[IMU / GPS]&#10;    D --&gt; J[Ogre2 渲染]&#10;    E --&gt; K[ros_gz_bridge]\">graph TD\n    A[Gazebo 仿真] --&gt; B[物理引擎]\n    A --&gt; C[传感器插件]\n    A --&gt; D[环境渲染]\n    A --&gt; E[ROS 桥接]\n    B --&gt; F[DART / Bullet]\n    C --&gt; G[激光雷达]\n    C --&gt; H[相机/深度相机]\n    C --&gt; I[IMU / GPS]\n    D --&gt; J[Ogre2 渲染]\n    E --&gt; K[ros_gz_bridge]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Gazebo 组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理引擎</td>\n<td>刚体/碰撞/关节</td>\n<td>SDF world 文件</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传感器系统</td>\n<td>模拟真实传感器</td>\n<td>SDF sensor 标签</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染引擎</td>\n<td>3D 可视化</td>\n<td>GUI 配置</td>\n<td>高（可关闭）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n<td>自定义行为</td>\n<td>C++ 插件</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ros_gz_bridge</td>\n<td>ROS 2 话题桥接</td>\n<td>YAML 配置</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sdf-世界文件\">SDF 世界文件</h2><p>SDF（Simulation Description Format）是 Gazebo 描述仿真世界的标准格式，包含物理属性、几何形状、传感器配置和插件加载等所有仿真要素。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;sdf version=&quot;1.9&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;world name=&quot;warehouse&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;physics name=&quot;1ms&quot; type=&quot;dart&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;max_step_size&gt;0.001&lt;/max_step_size&gt;&#10;      &lt;real_time_factor&gt;1.0&lt;/real_time_factor&gt;&#10;    &lt;/physics&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;light type=&quot;directional&quot; name=&quot;sun&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;cast_shadows&gt;true&lt;/cast_shadows&gt;&#10;      &lt;direction&gt;-0.5 0.1 -0.9&lt;/direction&gt;&#10;    &lt;/light&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;include&gt;&#10;      &lt;uri&gt;model://ground_plane&lt;/uri&gt;&#10;    &lt;/include&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;model name=&quot;obstacle_box&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;static&gt;true&lt;/static&gt;&#10;      &lt;pose&gt;2.0 0 0.5 0 0 0&lt;/pose&gt;&#10;      &lt;link name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;collision name=&quot;collision&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;geometry&gt;&lt;box&gt;&lt;size&gt;1 1 1&lt;/size&gt;&lt;/box&gt;&lt;/geometry&gt;&#10;        &lt;/collision&gt;&#10;        &lt;visual name=&quot;visual&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;geometry&gt;&lt;box&gt;&lt;size&gt;1 1 1&lt;/size&gt;&lt;/box&gt;&lt;/geometry&gt;&#10;        &lt;/visual&gt;&#10;      &lt;/link&gt;&#10;    &lt;/model&gt;&#10;  &lt;/world&gt;&#10;&lt;/sdf&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sdf</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.9\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">world</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">physics</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max_step_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0.001&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max_step_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">real_time_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>1.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">real_time_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">physics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">light</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"directional\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sun\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cast_shadows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cast_shadows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>-0.5 0.1 -0.9&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">light</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>model://ground_plane&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">model</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"obstacle_box\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>2.0 0 0.5 0 0 0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">collision</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"collision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>1 1 1&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">collision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">visual</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"visual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>1 1 1&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">visual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">world</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SDF 元素</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>world</td>\n<td>顶层仿真世界</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>physics</td>\n<td>物理引擎配置</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>model</td>\n<td>可交互的物体</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>link</td>\n<td>刚体（含碰撞和视觉）</td>\n<td>每个 model 至少一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>joint</td>\n<td>连接两个 link</td>\n<td>多体机器人需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sensor</td>\n<td>传感器定义</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>plugin</td>\n<td>自定义行为</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>max_step_size</code> 控制物理仿真的时间步长——步长越小物理模拟越精确但越慢。对于快速运动或刚性碰撞场景，可能需要更小的步长（如 0.0005s）来保证数值稳定性。<code>real_time_factor</code> 控制仿真速度与真实时间的比率：1.0 表示实时仿真，大于 1.0 表示加速（用于快速训练），小于 1.0 表示慢动作。</p>\n<p>SDF 与 URDF 的关系：URDF 是 ROS 生态中描述机器人模型的标准格式，SDF 是 Gazebo 的原生格式且功能更丰富（支持世界描述、传感器配置等）。Gazebo 可以直接加载 URDF 文件（内部自动转换为 SDF），但复杂的仿真场景通常需要直接编写 SDF。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传感器仿真\">传感器仿真</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;sensor name=&quot;lidar&quot; type=&quot;gpu_lidar&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;topic&gt;/scan&lt;/topic&gt;&#10;  &lt;update_rate&gt;10&lt;/update_rate&gt;&#10;  &lt;lidar&gt;&#10;    &lt;scan&gt;&#10;      &lt;horizontal&gt;&#10;        &lt;samples&gt;640&lt;/samples&gt;&#10;        &lt;min_angle&gt;-3.14159&lt;/min_angle&gt;&#10;        &lt;max_angle&gt;3.14159&lt;/max_angle&gt;&#10;      &lt;/horizontal&gt;&#10;    &lt;/scan&gt;&#10;    &lt;range&gt;&#10;      &lt;min&gt;0.08&lt;/min&gt;&#10;      &lt;max&gt;25.0&lt;/max&gt;&#10;    &lt;/range&gt;&#10;    &lt;noise&gt;&#10;      &lt;type&gt;gaussian&lt;/type&gt;&#10;      &lt;mean&gt;0.0&lt;/mean&gt;&#10;      &lt;stddev&gt;0.01&lt;/stddev&gt;&#10;    &lt;/noise&gt;&#10;  &lt;/lidar&gt;&#10;&lt;/sensor&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sensor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lidar\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpu_lidar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>/scan&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">update_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>10&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">update_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lidar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">horizontal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">samples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>640&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">samples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">min_angle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>-3.14159&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">min_angle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max_angle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>3.14159&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max_angle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">horizontal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0.08&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>25.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">noise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>gaussian&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">stddev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0.01&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">stddev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">noise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lidar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sensor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传感器类型</th>\n<th>Gazebo 标签</th>\n<th>输出话题类型</th>\n<th>GPU 加速</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2D 激光雷达</td>\n<td>gpu_lidar</td>\n<td>sensor_msgs/LaserScan</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D 激光雷达</td>\n<td>gpu_lidar</td>\n<td>sensor_msgs/PointCloud2</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGB 相机</td>\n<td>camera</td>\n<td>sensor_msgs/Image</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度相机</td>\n<td>rgbd_camera</td>\n<td>sensor_msgs/Image + PointCloud2</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IMU</td>\n<td>imu</td>\n<td>sensor_msgs/Imu</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>传感器噪声模型是缩小仿真与现实差距（Sim-to-Real Gap）的关键。高斯噪声是最常用的模型，但真实传感器的噪声往往更复杂：激光雷达在玻璃和镜面上产生多路径反射导致虚假读数，深度相机在物体边缘有系统性的深度失真，IMU 存在随温度变化的零偏漂移。</p>\n<p>为缩小 Sim-to-Real Gap，还需要考虑传感器的时序特性（采样率抖动、硬件延迟）和视场限制（盲区、最大探测距离）。domain randomization 技术通过在仿真中随机化传感器参数、光照条件和物体材质，使训练出的算法对噪声和不确定性更加鲁棒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ros-2-桥接\">ROS 2 桥接</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ros_gz_bridge 配置&#10;- ros_topic_name: &#39;/scan&#39;&#10;  gz_topic_name: &#39;/scan&#39;&#10;  ros_type_name: &#39;sensor_msgs/msg/LaserScan&#39;&#10;  gz_type_name: &#39;gz.msgs.LaserScan&#39;&#10;  direction: GZ_TO_ROS&#10;&#10;- ros_topic_name: &#39;/cmd_vel&#39;&#10;  gz_topic_name: &#39;/cmd_vel&#39;&#10;  ros_type_name: &#39;geometry_msgs/msg/Twist&#39;&#10;  gz_type_name: &#39;gz.msgs.Twist&#39;&#10;  direction: ROS_TO_GZ\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ros_gz_bridge 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ros_topic_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/scan'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gz_topic_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/scan'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ros_type_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sensor_msgs/msg/LaserScan'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gz_type_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gz.msgs.LaserScan'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GZ_TO_ROS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ros_topic_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/cmd_vel'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gz_topic_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/cmd_vel'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ros_type_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'geometry_msgs/msg/Twist'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gz_type_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gz.msgs.Twist'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ROS_TO_GZ</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ros_gz_bridge 是 Gazebo 和 ROS 2 之间的消息转换层。它将 Gazebo 内部的 Protobuf 消息格式转换为 ROS 2 的消息类型，反之亦然。bridge 节点通过 YAML 配置文件声明需要桥接的话题、消息类型和方向。</p>\n<p>桥接方向分为三种：GZ_TO_ROS（仿真数据发送到 ROS）、ROS_TO_GZ（ROS 控制命令发送到仿真）和 BIDIRECTIONAL（双向）。传感器数据通常是 GZ_TO_ROS，控制指令通常是 ROS_TO_GZ。</p>\n<h2 id=\"launch-文件集成\">Launch 文件集成</h2><p>在实际项目中，Gazebo 仿真通常通过 ROS 2 Launch 文件一键启动，同时加载世界文件、生成机器人模型和启动桥接节点。Launch 文件还可以通过参数切换仿真模式和真机模式——实现同一套代码在仿真和真机上运行（sim_mode 参数控制）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Gazebo 是 ROS 2 生态的标准仿真器，提供物理、传感器和渲染的完整仿真能力</li>\n<li>SDF 格式描述仿真世界中的所有实体，包括物理属性、碰撞几何和传感器配置</li>\n<li>物理步长和实时因子需要根据仿真精度和速度需求平衡调整</li>\n<li>传感器仿真支持添加高斯噪声，使仿真数据更接近真实传感器输出</li>\n<li>Domain randomization 技术通过随机化仿真参数来缩小 Sim-to-Real Gap</li>\n<li>ros_gz_bridge 负责 Gazebo 话题和 ROS 2 话题之间的双向转换</li>\n<li>无头模式（headless）可关闭渲染引擎，用于 CI/CD 和大规模并行仿真</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Gazebo 仿真基础","id":"gazebo-仿真基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SDF 世界文件","id":"sdf-世界文件"},{"level":2,"text":"传感器仿真","id":"传感器仿真"},{"level":2,"text":"ROS 2 桥接","id":"ros-2-桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"Launch 文件集成","id":"launch-文件集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字孪生技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/robot-simulation/digital-twin"},"next":{"title":"URDF 与机器人建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/robot-simulation/urdf-modeling"}}